# P3 #189: keep the committed vector store and scratch scripts out of the
# image — compose mounts a named volume at /app/chroma_db anyway, and the
# one-shot scripts (fix/clean_main/inspect) are dev tools, not runtime.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
chroma_db/
fix.py
clean_main.py
inspect_chroma.py
*.bak
.env
